le Certified Professional, Java SE Developer – Oracle\n\n**Skills:**\n- Proficient in Java, C#, Python, JavaScript, and SQL.\n- Experienced with frameworks and libraries: ReactJS, Angular, .NET Core, Node.js, React Native.\n- Familiarity with version control systems including Git, GitHub, and SVN.\n- Excellent problem-solving and analytical skills.\n- Strong teamwork and communication abilities.\n\n**Projects:**\n",
